    its content is the Persian strings, not English - Strings.en.resx and
    Strings.ar.resx are the satellites. Hand-maintained (no Visual Studio
    resx designer available in this environment) - see Strings.cs for the
    hand-written strongly-typed wrapper that reads these via
    System.Resources.ResourceManager, the same underlying mechanism the
    VS-generated Designer.cs would produce.
